            <p><strong>Thank you for choosing Orion Malware Cleaner.</strong> It's important to understand that this is <strong>not an antivirus replacement</strong> with real-time protection. Instead, it is a powerful, on-demand threat investigation and remediation toolkit designed for knowledgeable users to hunt for and remove active and dormant threats.</p>
            <p>This guide will walk you through the entire process, from launching the script to understanding its findings and taking action. The tool is designed to be powerful, but its effectiveness relies on informed decisions from you, the operator.</p>

